---
/**
 * Cannae battlefield diagram.
 *
 * Two-phase SVG illustration of the famous double envelopment.
 * Phase 1 shows initial deployment with the Carthaginian crescent
 * bowed forward and African heavy infantry held back on the wings.
 * Phase 2 shows the envelopment: Roman center pushed deep into the
 * (now flexed-back) crescent; African wings wheeling inward;
 * Carthaginian cavalry returned from breaking Roman cavalry to
 * strike the Roman rear.
 */
---

<figure class="my-8">
  <h3 class="font-serif text-xl mb-3">Battlefield diagram: the double envelopment</h3>

  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

    <!-- Phase 1: Initial deployment -->
    <div class="border border-sand-300 rounded-lg bg-sand-50 p-4">
      <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-sand-700 mb-2">Phase 1 · Initial deployment</div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 320" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full" role="img" aria-labelledby="cannae-phase-1-title">
        <title id="cannae-phase-1-title">Initial deployment at Cannae</title>

        <!-- North arrow -->
        <g transform="translate(20, 25)">
          <line x1="0" y1="10" x2="0" y2="-8" stroke="#6b5638" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <polygon points="0,-12 -4,-4 4,-4" fill="#6b5638"/>
          <text x="6" y="2" font-size="9" fill="#6b5638">N</text>
        </g>

        <!-- Background terrain hint -->
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="400" height="320" fill="#faf7f2"/>

        <!-- Aufidus river hint at top -->
        <path d="M 0 12 Q 100 20 200 12 T 400 12" stroke="#7dd3fc" stroke-width="2" fill="none" opacity="0.7"/>
        <text x="200" y="32" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#0369a1" font-style="italic">Aufidus river</text>

        <!-- ROMAN ARMY (north side, facing south) -->
        <!-- Italian allied cavalry (Roman left) -->
        <rect x="40" y="55" width="50" height="22" fill="#fca5a5" stroke="#7f1d1d" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="65" y="49" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#7f1d1d">Italian cav.</text>

        <!-- Roman heavy infantry (deepened) -->
        <rect x="100" y="50" width="200" height="32" fill="#dc2626" stroke="#7f1d1d" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="200" y="69" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#fff" font-weight="600">Roman legions (deepened)</text>

        <!-- Roman cavalry (Roman right) -->
        <rect x="310" y="55" width="50" height="22" fill="#dc2626" stroke="#7f1d1d" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="335" y="49" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#7f1d1d">Roman cav.</text>

        <!-- CARTHAGINIAN ARMY (south side, facing north) -->
        <!-- Numidian cavalry (Hannibal's right, facing Roman left) -->
        <rect x="40" y="240" width="50" height="22" fill="#92400e" stroke="#451a03" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="65" y="276" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#451a03">Numidian cav.</text>

        <!-- African heavy infantry left wing (held back) -->
        <rect x="100" y="245" width="50" height="20" fill="#3d0a21" stroke="#1a0410" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="125" y="278" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#3d0a21">Africans (back)</text>

        <!-- Iberian/Gallic crescent in center (bowed forward = north) -->
        <path d="M 150 245 Q 200 175 250 245" fill="#fbbf24" stroke="#92400e" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="200" y="200" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#451a03">Iberian/Gallic crescent</text>
        <text x="200" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#451a03" font-style="italic">(bowed forward)</text>

        <!-- African heavy infantry right wing (held back) -->
        <rect x="250" y="245" width="50" height="20" fill="#3d0a21" stroke="#1a0410" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="275" y="278" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#3d0a21">Africans (back)</text>

        <!-- Carthaginian heavy cavalry (Hannibal's left, under Hasdrubal, facing Roman right) -->
        <rect x="310" y="240" width="50" height="22" fill="#5b0f31" stroke="#1a0410" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="335" y="276" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#1a0410">Carth. cav. (Hasdrubal)</text>

        <!-- Hannibal label -->
        <text x="200" y="310" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#5b0f31" font-style="italic">Hannibal commanding</text>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <!-- Phase 2: The envelopment -->
    <div class="border border-sand-300 rounded-lg bg-sand-50 p-4">
      <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-sand-700 mb-2">Phase 2 · The envelopment</div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 320" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full" role="img" aria-labelledby="cannae-phase-2-title">
        <title id="cannae-phase-2-title">The double envelopment at Cannae</title>

        <!-- Background -->
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="400" height="320" fill="#faf7f2"/>

        <!-- Aufidus river hint at top -->
        <path d="M 0 12 Q 100 20 200 12 T 400 12" stroke="#7dd3fc" stroke-width="2" fill="none" opacity="0.7"/>

        <!-- The crescent has flexed back; Roman center has pushed into it -->
        <!-- Reversed crescent (now bowed south, with Romans inside) -->
        <path d="M 100 100 Q 200 200 300 100" fill="none" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="4,3" opacity="0.6"/>
        <text x="200" y="92" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#92400e" font-style="italic">(crescent flexed back)</text>

        <!-- Roman legions trapped inside -->
        <rect x="130" y="115" width="140" height="60" fill="#dc2626" stroke="#7f1d1d" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="200" y="148" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#fff" font-weight="600">Roman legions</text>
        <text x="200" y="161" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#fff">(encircled)</text>

        <!-- African heavy infantry wheeling inward (left wing) -->
        <rect x="60" y="130" width="60" height="35" fill="#3d0a21" stroke="#1a0410" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="90" y="152" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#fff">Africans</text>
        <!-- Arrow showing wheel -->
        <path d="M 120 148 L 132 148" stroke="#3d0a21" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-cannae-2)"/>

        <!-- African heavy infantry wheeling inward (right wing) -->
        <rect x="280" y="130" width="60" height="35" fill="#3d0a21" stroke="#1a0410" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="310" y="152" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#fff">Africans</text>
        <path d="M 280 148 L 268 148" stroke="#3d0a21" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-cannae-2)"/>

        <!-- Carthaginian cavalry returned to attack Roman rear -->
        <rect x="130" y="220" width="140" height="25" fill="#5b0f31" stroke="#1a0410" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="200" y="237" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#fff">Cavalry strike on rear</text>
        <!-- Arrow upward -->
        <path d="M 200 218 L 200 188" stroke="#5b0f31" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-cannae-2)"/>

        <!-- Roman cavalry destroyed (faint, broken) -->
        <rect x="40" y="55" width="50" height="22" fill="#fca5a5" stroke="#7f1d1d" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,2" opacity="0.4"/>
        <text x="65" y="50" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#7f1d1d" opacity="0.6">Italian cav. broken</text>
        <rect x="310" y="55" width="50" height="22" fill="#dc2626" stroke="#7f1d1d" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3,2" opacity="0.4"/>
        <text x="335" y="50" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#7f1d1d" opacity="0.6">Roman cav. broken</text>

        <!-- Arrow markers definition -->
        <defs>
          <marker id="arrow-cannae-2" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto">
            <path d="M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z" fill="#1a0410"/>
          </marker>
        </defs>

        <!-- Operation summary -->
        <text x="200" y="280" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#5b0f31" font-style="italic">~50,000 Roman casualties in a single afternoon</text>
      </svg>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Legend -->
  <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-[11px] text-sand-700">
    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 bg-red-600 border border-red-900"></span> Roman legions</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 bg-red-300 border border-red-900"></span> Italian allied cav.</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 bg-amber-300 border border-amber-700"></span> Iberian / Gallic infantry</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 bg-tyrian-900 border border-black"></span> African heavy infantry</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 bg-tyrian-700 border border-black"></span> Carthaginian cavalry</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 bg-amber-700 border border-amber-900"></span> Numidian cavalry</span>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs text-sand-700 italic">
    Schematic, not to scale. Hannibal placed his weakest troops (Iberians and Gauls)
    in a forward crescent that flexed back as Roman pressure built; his veteran
    African heavy infantry on the wings then wheeled inward to attack Roman flanks
    while his cavalry, having broken both Roman cavalry wings, returned to strike
    the Roman rear. The result was complete encirclement.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
